  designNotes: 'The user, 2026-10-16: a poisoned gift. Played on your side, it deploys
    for 2 Days; on arrival it goes over to the enemy, into the slot opposite, and
    whatever stands there is discarded. There it''s a Turncoat: no summon can replace
    it and they can''t order it to attack; each Dawn it attacks a random other creature
    of its new side, Reveals another (you see its plans) and takes 1 Attack off another.
    Low Health: they can knock it out easily (Friendly Fire, an effect).'
  artDescription: A serene robed figure bowing slightly and offering an ornate gift
    box tied with a gold ribbon, both hands extended in welcome; on the wall behind,
    the box's shadow is a coiled snake.
